    <panel_attributes>Design patterns in this diagram
--
MVC: FinancialView/GUIView/CLIView (View), FinancialController (Controller), MonthlySummary/FinancialEntry/FinancialService (Model)
Facade: FinAssistFacade hides the services, SavingsAnalyzer, AgentOrchestrator and VoiceInputService
Strategy: SavingsAnalyzer (Context), SavingsStrategy, GoalBasedSavingsStrategy, ExpenseBasedSavingsStrategy
Observer: FinancialDataSubject (Subject), FinancialObserver; DashboardService, SavingsAnalyzer, ExpenseDetectionAgent are observers
Factory Method: AgentCreator (Creator), ExpenseDetectionCreator, FinancialCoachCreator; product FinancialAgent
bg=#FFFFCC</panel_attributes>
